🔴 **Two of the wiki's fifteen rows are already NOT DISCRIMINABLE on this build, before secure
mode is touched** — and only a normal-mode baseline could show that:

- **`crypto key generate hostkey ?` offers only ecdsa, ed25519 and rsa in NORMAL mode.**
  There is **no rsa1 and no dsa keyword at all** on `sin_x96056-20261019-27`. The wiki row
  *"rsa1 and dsa keys are not supported in secure-mode"* therefore has nothing to withdraw
  here. It cannot be confirmed as a secure-mode difference on this unit; the title's "RSA1,
  DSA" clause is satisfied **at all times**, which is a different statement.
- **`aaa group server ?` offers only ldap and radius in NORMAL mode.** There is **no `tacacs+`
  keyword**, matching `platforms/x960.md` §7E.7. The wiki row *"TACACS+ groups NOT allowed"*
  likewise has nothing to withdraw.

